{
  "name": "scenario-agriculture",
  "description": "Agriculture vertical: 3 domain device-type templates (soil_moisture_probe / irrigation_valve / weather_station), 9 devices across north/south/greenhouse zones, and seeded telemetry with a clear 'north dry, south wet, greenhouse borderline' moisture distribution. Lets domain-reasoning cases (driest-zone detection, auto-irrigation rules, dry-spell workflows) be evaluated with deterministic, hard-checkable outcomes.",
